        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Lab. Survive the Creator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in a frozen, decaying laboratory buried deep in the Siberian mountains. You are <strong>Mia</strong>, a young girl raised in isolation as the prototype for <i>The Klon Projekt</i> — a secret Soviet experiment to create a perfect clone. But something went wrong, and now you're the last survivor of a failed program abandoned by the Russian government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only other soul left is <strong>Dr. Ivan Schultz</strong>, your creator, who has gone mad from guilt and isolation. He believes you are the final mistake that must be erased — and he is hunting you through the dark halls of the lab.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person psychological horror experience</strong> taking place in a frozen Soviet lab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-based survival gameplay</strong> — hide, evade, and outsmart Ivan to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-focused progression</strong> — search rooms, unlock doors, and find clues to your past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-rich storytelling</strong> told through environmental details, documents, and voice recordings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack and immersive sound design</strong> to create an intense, cinematic atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>1–2 hours</strong>, depending on how deeply you explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to escape your horrifying past — or be consumed by it.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Lab. Survive the Creator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in a frozen, decaying laboratory buried deep in the Siberian mountains. You are <strong>Mia</strong>, a young girl raised in isolation as the prototype for <i>The Klon Projekt</i> — a secret Soviet experiment to create a perfect clone. But something went wrong, and now you're the last survivor of a failed program abandoned by the Russian government.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only other soul left is <strong>Dr. Ivan Schultz</strong>, your creator, who has gone mad from guilt and isolation. He believes you are the final mistake that must be erased — and he is hunting you through the dark halls of the lab.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person psychological horror experience</strong> taking place in a frozen Soviet lab</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-based survival gameplay</strong> — hide, evade, and outsmart Ivan to escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-focused progression</strong> — search rooms, unlock doors, and find clues to your past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-rich storytelling</strong> told through environmental details, documents, and voice recordings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original soundtrack and immersive sound design</strong> to create an intense, cinematic atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: <strong>1–2 hours</strong>, depending on how deeply you explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to escape your horrifying past — or be consumed by it.</p>",
